From: ao3-browser <ao3@example.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: AO3 Browser branding, slim UI and builtin extension

Renames the app to "AO3 Browser", hides settings entries unrelated to
AO3 reading (account, Google services, payments, voice search etc.),
and bundles the AO3 Translator extension as a default component
extension that is loaded on first run.

License: GPL-3.0-only - https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-only.html
---
 chrome/android/java/res/xml/main_preferences.xml       | 10 +++++-----
 .../java/res_chromium_base/values/channel_constants.xml | 10 +++++-----
 chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING                     |  8 ++++----
 chrome/browser/extensions/BUILD.gn                     |  1 +
 chrome/browser/extensions/component_extensions_loader.cc | 9 +++++++++
 chrome/browser/extensions/default_extensions/BUILD.gn   |  9 +++++++++
 6 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/android/java/res/xml/main_preferences.xml b/chrome/android/java/res/xml/main_preferences.xml
